abstract: >
  Offline multi-fidelity blackbox for DPO hyperparameter selection (learning rate
  and β), including checkpoint evaluation tables, construction code, and HPO
  simulation traces for Qwen3 and Llama model sizes. Preference settings:
  Dolci-Instruct-DPO (default) and UltraFeedback.
keywords:
  - DPO
  - hyperparameter optimization
  - blackbox benchmark
  - multi-fidelity
  - large language models
